tain. B's communication issues are known but manageable. D's moodiness and loner may affect crew cooperation. So we need to argue whether B remains best. Likely we maintain B, but we can note D's adaptability is good but still concerns about crew cooperation and feedback orientation. So we will reaffirm B.\n\nWe need to reference the new info: D's adaptability is adequate, but feedback orientation unknown, and his moody/loner traits remain concerns. Also we can compare to B's known strengths. So we will state we still recommend B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
